://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T12:36:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T12:37:16Z","body":"For me if it starts with `Check Newest Stable` it doesn't suggest `4.6.dev1`.\n- After changing to `Check Newest Patch` it still doesn't suggest `4.6.dev1`.\n- Changing to `Check Newest Preview` makes it suggest `4.6.dev1`.\n  - After that, switching to either `Check Newest Stable`/`Check Newest Patch` makes it still suggest `4.6.dev1`, until after restarting the project manager.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a37829d8-0d64-4e13-b695-5f37ac923f72","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361022712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361106994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111161#issuecomment-3361106994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111161","id":3361106994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IVmwy","user":{"login":"mgiuca","id":228433,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODQzMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228433?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca","html_url":"https://github.com/mgiuca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T12:53:33Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T12:53:33Z","body":"Ah, thanks for spotting that. I do indeed have \"Check for Updates\" set to \"Check Newest Preview\".\n\nI was confused why my 4.4.1 does not check for the dev version whereas 4.5 does. It turns out that this setting name has changed between 4.4 and 4.5; it was called `engine_version_update_mode` and now it's called `check_for_updates`. Somehow I had it set to \"stable\" in 4.4 and \"preview\" in 4.5. (I don't remember changing it but I might have - I did use the 4.5 dev and beta branches.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361106994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361180053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111161#issuecomment-3361180053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111161","id":3361180053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IV4mV","user":{"login":"erwan-privat","id":7803